WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.251 --> 00:00:20.434
groaned. "We destroyed so many robots.

2
00:00:20.915 --> 00:00:22.436
And now they've all been fixed!

3
00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.078
It's like we didn't do anything at all!"

4
00:00:28.979 --> 00:00:29.840
Roxy felt bad.

5
00:00:30.664 --> 00:00:34.505
She wanted to help the Delkorians, but this mission was taking a really long time.

6
00:00:35.646 --> 00:00:36.826
Cozlin held up her hand.

7
00:00:37.446 --> 00:00:42.668
Zap! One robot exploded, and three others fell over, lifeless.

8
00:00:43.968 --> 00:00:47.169
Roxy flew over and grabbed one of the lifeless robots.

9
00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.250
She and Cozlin took it into their spaceship.

10
00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:57.012
"Let's get this robot to the bunker," Cozlin said.

11
00:00:57.996 --> 00:01:01.940
"An expert can study its technology and figure out where it came from."

12
00:01:06.404 --> 00:01:07.585
They flew back to the bunker.

13
00:01:08.826 --> 00:01:11.788
But now the grassy hill was covered in large pieces of metal.

14
00:01:12.969 --> 00:01:15.111
Robots were welding the pieces of metal together.

15
00:01:15.131 --> 00:01:17.653
"What are they doing?"

16
00:01:18.114 --> 00:01:18.794
Roxy asked.

17
00:01:18.814 --> 00:01:21.897
"I don't know," Cozlin said.

18
00:01:21.917 --> 00:01:24.840
"But we can't get into the bunker now."

19
00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.833
She turned on her communication device.

20
00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:30.414
"This is Kid Comet.

21
00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:32.736
Is everyone okay inside the bunker?"

22
00:01:32.756 --> 00:01:35.857
"Yes," a voice said.

23
00:01:35.877 --> 00:01:37.398
"What's going on out there?"

24
00:01:37.418 --> 00:01:41.321
"Robots covered the entrance," Cozlin said.

25
00:01:41.341 --> 00:01:43.302
"We can't get in."

26
00:01:44.742 --> 00:01:48.384
"Maybe we can get help in a different city," Roxy said.

27
00:01:48.404 --> 00:01:53.067
"Every city on Delkor has been overrun by robots," the voice said.

28
00:01:53.087 --> 00:01:54.588
"No place is safe!"

29
00:01:55.584 --> 00:01:56.405
Cozlin gulped.

30
00:01:56.425 --> 00:01:58.427
"Don't worry!

31
00:01:59.007 --> 00:02:00.048
We'll stop them."

32
00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.892
"She's scared," Roxy thought.

33
00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:07.555
Just then a robot jumped onto the outside of their ship.

34
00:02:08.977 --> 00:02:11.159
It punched into a wing and tried to pull it apart.

35
00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:13.421
"Oh no!"

36
00:02:13.881 --> 00:02:14.682
Cozlin shouted.

37
00:02:16.344 --> 00:02:17.465
Roxy flew outside.

38
00:02:18.446 --> 00:02:19.987
She knocked the robot off the wing.

39
00:02:23.964 --> 00:02:27.186
Using her heat vision, she quickly welded the wing back together.

40
00:02:28.587 --> 00:02:30.689
Then more robots tried to attack the ship.

41
00:02:31.949 --> 00:02:34.891
Roxy went back inside, and Cozlin flew up into orbit.

42
00:02:39.715 --> 00:02:41.796
not safe down there," Roxy said.

43
00:02:41.816 --> 00:02:45.879
"How will we figure out where the robots came from?"

44
00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.881
Cozlin was pressing buttons on the dashboard.

45
00:02:49.901 --> 00:02:53.664
"My aunt Fezlin is a technology researcher.

46
00:02:54.972 --> 00:02:56.633
She lives on Asteroid Number 4.

47
00:02:57.854 --> 00:03:01.116
It's a huge asteroid that orbits Delkor's star.

48
00:03:02.436 --> 00:03:04.938
We can see if she knows anything about the robots."

49
00:03:06.659 --> 00:03:09.540
The power crystal glowed, and the spaceship shot through space.

50
00:03:19.106 --> 00:03:29.756
Minutes later Cozlin's spaceship was docking on Asteroid Number 4.

51
00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:33.117
"I'm even farther from Earth now," Roxy thought.

52
00:03:36.798 --> 00:03:38.178
Aunt Fezlin hugged Cozlin.

53
00:03:39.159 --> 00:03:42.080
"I've been hearing reports about what's happening on Delkor.

54
00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.300
I'm glad you're safe, Cozlin."

55
00:03:45.601 --> 00:03:47.121
Cozlin looked at Roxy and shrugged.

56
00:03:47.141 --> 00:03:49.102
"That's my real name."

57
00:03:50.242 --> 00:03:51.102
Roxy smiled.

58
00:03:51.122 --> 00:03:52.863
"Mine is Roxy."

59
00:03:52.883 --> 00:03:57.204
"It's nice to meet you, Roxy," Aunt Fezlin said.

60
00:03:58.688 --> 00:04:04.711
"Cozlin acts like she never needs help, but everyone needs a teammate sometimes."

61
00:04:05.871 --> 00:04:06.751
Cozlin shrugged.

62
00:04:06.771 --> 00:04:10.233
"Roxy isn't a teammate.

63
00:04:10.793 --> 00:04:12.634
She's just helping me."

64
00:04:12.654 --> 00:04:16.315
"That's right," Roxy said, pretending to agree.

65
00:04:16.335 --> 00:04:18.516
"Cozlin doesn't even need my help.

66
00:04:18.816 --> 00:04:23.979
In fact, maybe I should just go home to my own—" "Sorry!"

67
00:04:24.419 --> 00:04:25.439
Cozlin said quickly.

68
00:04:25.459 --> 00:04:28.536
"Please don't go—I do need your help."

69
00:04:29.557 --> 00:04:30.317
Roxy smiled.

70
00:04:30.337 --> 00:04:31.657
"I'll stay."

71
00:04:34.518 --> 00:04:37.099
Aunt Fezlin examined the robot, taking it apart.

72
00:04:38.239 --> 00:04:40.060
She looked closely at how it had been built.

73
00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:45.921
"This technology is from the Varda Region," she said finally.

74
00:04:45.941 --> 00:04:50.202
"Then that's where we need to go," Cozlin said.

75
00:04:51.803 --> 00:04:53.223
Roxy had a sinking feeling.

76
00:04:53.243 --> 00:04:55.924
"How far away is that?"

77
00:04:56.972 --> 00:04:57.793
Cozlin shrugged.

78
00:04:57.813 --> 00:05:00.537
"About a million light-years."

79
00:05:02.779 --> 00:05:03.741
Roxy sighed.

80
00:05:03.761 --> 00:05:08.667
"This mission is taking me farther and farther from home!"
